WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:01.477
Hello I'm a citizen.

00:00:01.477 --> 00:00:03.376
And I'm the government.

00:00:03.376 --> 00:00:05.110
Sorry to see you go.

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:06.866
What do you mean? 

00:00:06.866 --> 00:00:10.767
We had an election, new president, new congress, new everything. 

00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:13.920
Yeah that's me. 

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:14.976
But you're still you.

00:00:14.976 --> 00:00:21.866
Yeah but my tie is a different color now, so, whole new me. 

00:00:21.866 --> 00:00:24.361
I'm really looking forward to working without you.

